OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fmelting away this evening to leave
OL,7,Fplenty of evening sunshine. Holding
OL,8,Fonto clear skies through the night and
OL,9,Fremaining warm and humid with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAnothe fine and settled day
OL,13,Facross the region with a good deal of
OL,14,Fsunshine. Turning hot in the
OL,15,Fafternoon, with light winds. Low
OL,16,Fchance of a shower later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
