OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FFeeling less hot on Thursday with
OL,7,Fsunny spells and the odd shower.
OL,8,FLargely dry on Friday. Sunny spells
OL,9,Fand a few showers on Saturday too.
OL,10,FStill feeling pleasantly warm.
